.TH TOUCH "1" "July 2026" "PiggyOS" "User Commands"

.SH NAME
touch \- create file, or change file timestamps

.SH SYNOPSIS
.B touch
[\fI\,OPTION\/\fR]... \fI\,FILE\/\fR...

.SH DESCRIPTION

.PP
Update the access and modifications times of each FILE to the current time.

.PP
A FILE argument that does not exist is created empty, unless -c is supplied.

.SH OPTIONS

.TP
.B \-a
only update the access time

.TP
.B \-c
do not create any files

.TP
.B \-h
do not dereference symbolic links and instead update them directly

.TP
.B \-m
only update the modification time

.TP
.B \-r FILE
use this FILE's times instead of current time 

